  - LineID: IV
    Speaker: Chime(Human)
    text: They must remember now...that I fell from this tree...that they tried to
      save me, but didn't make it in time...Echo, I'm so sorry you had to remember
      this way.
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
